# Reserved for locally-hosted brand assets.
#
# Currently the site uses Unsplash hot-links for background photography
# (see the .env-* rules in styles.css). To self-host:
#
#   1. Place high-res images here, e.g.:
#        assets/hero.jpg
#        assets/corridor.jpg
#        assets/assembly.jpg
#        assets/lab.jpg
#        assets/control.jpg
#        assets/network.jpg
#        assets/command.jpg
#   2. Swap the URL strings in styles.css (.env-* rules) to "./assets/<name>.jpg".
